<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel"> 
      <p xml:id="Aink166-kilavi">
        varaiyātu vantoḻukun talaimakaṉ ciṟaippuṟattāṉākat talaimakaḷ pacappiṟku varuntiya tōḻi avaṉai iyaṟpaḻittuk kūṟiyatu.</p>    <p xml:lang="en">
        Spoken by the confidante who was hurt at the palour of the heroine, belittling him - the hero - who was one at the backdoor [listening in], having come without [intentions to] marry.   </p>
  </div>  
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="Aink166">
<l>peruṅkaṭaṟ karaiyatu ciṟuveṇ kākkai</l>
<l>variveṇ ṭāli valaicettu verūu</l>
<l>mellam pulampaṟ ṟēṟi</l>
<l>nalla vāyiṉa nallōḷ kaṇṇē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
        <l>Having trusted the man from the soft, pretty shores</l>
        <l>Where the small white crow of the vast seashore fears</l>
        <l>The rows of white Tāli fish, thinking [it is] a net,</l>
        <l>The good lady’s eyes have become [with sarcasm,] good!</l>      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
